// The question pool for the Daily puzzle.
//
// Five categories, five levels, six questions in each slot (150 in all), so
// the rotation in puzzle.js can give every day one question per category,
// easiest first, and use each question exactly once every thirty days.
//
// APPEND ONLY. Never insert, reorder or delete: puzzles #1–#15 are frozen
// (tests/daily.test.js) and the rotation picks questions by their position in
// each slot. Batch 1 (the first 75) was written by Dev on 2026-11-23; batch 2
// (the 75 after it) by R&D, with a source for every fact in
// company/research/daily-questions-batch-2.md (section B).
//
// The correct option is always written FIRST here; puzzle.js shuffles the order
// shown to players (the same way for everyone, and the same in both languages).
// Every fact is checked: a wrong answer in a shared puzzle costs trust fast.

